        <headline>Flood Advisory issued September 24 at 6:58PM PDT until September 24 at 7:00PM PDT by NWS Las Vegas NV</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 7 PM MST this evening for a portion
of northwest Arizona, including the following area, Mohave.

Flood waters have receded. The heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no
longer expected to pose a threat. Please continue to heed remaining
road closures.
</description>
